# Where the lanes are served. Either a JSON array in PONG_LANES, or a file path in PONG_LANES_FILE (see
# lanes.example.json). With neither set, one lane runs: a System One server at http://127.0.0.1:8100.
# No key is needed for a System One lane. A chat lane may carry an apiKey in its entry.
PONG_LANES_FILE=
